    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms161126065>;
    <https://schema.org/text> "We conclude that a small set of cell-level behaviors, such as migration and cell-cell signaling that are known to be regulated by GJC and thus are perturbed by octanol exposure [35,39,49,98,101,102], can quantitatively explain the morphologies we observed in planaria.".
